# Line endings: normalise text files in the repo, leave binaries untouched.
# Specific rules below override this one, so it has to come first.
* text=auto

# Binary assets -- never line-ending-converted, never diffed as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.pptx  binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git LFS
#
# Model checkpoints only. runs/ddpm/last.pt is 138 MB on its own, past
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit for an ordinary blob, and the three checkpoints
# together are ~208 MB of the repo's ~230 MB.
#
# Requires `git lfs install` once per machine, and an LFS-enabled remote.
# LFS applies only to commits made after this rule exists -- a checkpoint
# already committed as a normal blob stays in history until it is rewritten.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pt  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
